d":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"If a LEARNER fails for longer than FLAGS_follower_unavailable_considered_failed_sec (default 300 seconds), we should unconditionally remove it from the config, but currently if there are only two voters left in the config when a LEARNER fails, we won't remove the LEARNER:\r\n\r\n ```\r\nif (unreachable_time.ToSeconds() > FLAGS_follower_unavailable_considered_failed_sec) {\r\n    if (CountVoters(*queue_state_.active_config) > 2) {\r\n      // We never drop from 2 to 1 automatically, at least for now. We may want to revisit this\r\n      // later, we're just being cautious with this.\r\n      string msg = Substitute(\"Leader has been unable to successfully communicate \"\r\n                              \"with Peer $0 for more than $1 seconds ($2)\",\r\n                              uuid,\r\n                              FLAGS_follower_unavailable_considered_failed_sec,\r\n                              unreachable_time.ToString());\r\n      NotifyObserversOfFailedFollower(uuid, queue_state_.current_term, msg);\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"hectorgcr","id":20052555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMDUyNTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20052555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr","html_url":"https://github.com/hectorgcr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hectorgcr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url